      <title>AkzoNobel/Axalta readies EU resilience and sustainability arguments </title>
      <link>https://globalcompetitionreview.com/article/akzonobelaxalta-readies-eu-resilience-and-sustainability-arguments</link>
      <description>Rival paintmakers AkzoNobel and Axalta will argue that their $25 billion merger will boost supply chain resilience in the EU and sustainability objectives, despite overlaps in the powder and vehicle refinish coatings markets.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://globalcompetitionreview.com/article/akzonobelaxalta-readies-eu-resilience-and-sustainability-arguments</guid>
