    <item>
      <title>To the Brink: The Tipline for 20 March 2026</title>
      <link>https://globalcompetitionreview.com/gcr-usa/article/the-brink-the-tipline-20-march-2026</link>
      <description>The departure of antitrust leadership at the Department of Justice continues. Patty Brink, assistant chief of the Antitrust Division’s international section, is retiring this summer after more than 35 years of service. The head of the division’s New York office has also announced his resignation. Also in Tipline, the Federal Trade Commission has announced a new healthcare task force.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://globalcompetitionreview.com/gcr-usa/article/the-brink-the-tipline-20-march-2026</guid>
      <enclosure url="/images/logos/gcr-logo.svg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
      <pubDate>Fri, 20 Mar 2026 18:27:19 +0000</pubDate>
    </item>
