    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Cable makers fight disclosure requests in UK class action</title>
      <link>https://globalcompetitionreview.com/article/cable-makers-fight-disclosure-requests-in-uk-class-action</link>
      <description>Prysmian, Nexans and NKT have urged the UK’s Competition Appeal Tribunal to reject disclosure requests from a class representative seeking to rely on evidence from six separate lawsuits that targeted the cable makers.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://globalcompetitionreview.com/article/cable-makers-fight-disclosure-requests-in-uk-class-action</guid>
      <enclosure url="https://d2qu5xmcgmzxnb.cloudfront." length="0" type="image/jpeg"/>
